### VS Code "REST Client" extension. Run `python manage.py seed_quiz` first.
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api
@auth = Basic ZGVtbzpkZW1vMTIzNDU=

### List exams (public)
GET {{base}}/exams/

### Exam detail
GET {{base}}/exams/1/

### Create question with nested choices
POST {{base}}/questions/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{auth}}

{"exam": 1, "text": "Which verb creates a resource?", "points": 2,
 "choices": [{"text": "POST", "is_correct": true}, {"text": "GET", "is_correct": false},
             {"text": "HEAD", "is_correct": false}, {"text": "TRACE", "is_correct": false}]}

### Partial update
PATCH {{base}}/questions/1/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{auth}}

{"points": 5}

### Delete
DELETE {{base}}/questions/8/
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Error: required field missing -> 400
POST {{base}}/exams/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{auth}}

{"description": "no title"}

### Filter and search
GET {{base}}/questions/?exam=1
###
GET {{base}}/questions/?search=django
###
GET {{base}}/questions/?page=2
